# Agent picks the model

On every new user request:

1. Call MCP `pick_model` with the user task text.
2. Run the work with the Cursor `Task` tool, passing `model` = the returned `SLUG`.
3. First line of the user-facing reply: `MODEL: <display name>`.

Do not ask the user to change the Cursor model picker. Do not print Auto or default as the model name.
